  "configuration_id": "config_045",
  "reason": "The current best (config_038: scvi_n200 + imagenet_vit_l + transformer + weighted, acc=0.725) establishes that scvi_n200, transformer aggregation, and weighted fusion are the strongest components. The key remaining uncertainty is whether the transformer aggregation benefit is specific to imagenet_vit_l or generalizable across image encoders. config_045 (scvi_n200 + resnet50 + transformer + weighted) isolates this interaction: we know scvi_n200+resnet50+avgpool+weighted=0.678 (config_028), and transformer gave +0.019 over avgpool with imagenet_vit_l (0.706→0.725). If transformer aggregation also helps resnet50 comparably, this could reach ~0.697–0.71; if the interaction is synergistic, it could approach or exceed 0.725. Among all untested configs, this is the closest logical extension of the best configuration (only one component changed) and directly tests the one remaining design-space question near the optimum. As the final experiment, it maximizes the probability of either discovering a new best or confirming the current best is robust."
}

